No quotation marks here at all.

Backticks ` and apostrophes ' stay: it's `C' not ``C''.
``Already TeX style'' must pass through unchanged, also '' and `` alone: '' ``
   leading spaces are kept
 !#$%&'()*+,-./0123456789:;<=>?@ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ[\]^_`abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz{|}~


!#$%&()*+,-./:;<=>?@[\]^_{|}~ 0123456789 ABC xyz
